FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Salut !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Tu viens visiter {{TAG:0005:0005:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Le voyage n'était pas trop
fatigant ?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je suis venue ici pour faire un peu
de camping pendant quelque temps.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
La ville est si belle en hiver !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tutti quanti associano il campeggio
all'estate,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma in realtà secondo me
è divertentissimo anche in inverno!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dovresti provare anche tu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
una volta!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çoğu insan kamp deyince yazı düşünüyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama sıcak kalmayı başarırsan kışın da en az
o kadar güzel.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu viens souvent à {{TAG:0005:0005:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Pour moi, c'est la ville idéale pour
passer ses vacances !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vieni spesso qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È davvero il luogo ideale per
una vacanza rilassante,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} non trovi?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hello!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Are you from this town?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
I thought it might be a little cold for
camping,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but it's actually very nice.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Vaya, hola!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} ¿Eres de este pueblo?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Yo he decidido desafiar al frío
y venirme de acampada.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bonjour!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Abiti qui?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sono venuta in questa città
per fare un po' di campeggio.
Devo dire,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} non pensavo che
mi sarei trovata così bene qui!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È un posticino davvero accogliente!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} merhaba!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Bu kasabadan mısın?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Kamp için biraz fazla soğuk olur sanmıştım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama aslında çok güzelmiş.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bonjour!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono venuta a visitare
la vostra città{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} e a fare
un po' di campeggio!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono entusiasta di questo luogo:{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}cibo squisito,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} aria cristallina{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Cosa potrei chiedere di più?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Hmmm, wo soll ich nur hinziehen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Am wichtigsten wäre mir ein
Fleckchen mit einer tollen Aussicht.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Un hiver doux et enneigé, c'est une
raison de plus d'emménager !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Vivement que je pose mes valises !

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci beaucoup, mais {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
t'a devancé{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006500}} :{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} mon emménagement
dans cette ville est pour bientôt !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hat mich schon dazu
überredet, hierher umzuziehen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich freue mich darauf!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Your friend {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
convinced me to move to town.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Everyone here seems so nice!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sai... parlando con{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}
mi sono decisa a trasferirmi qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Siete tutti così gentiiili!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}How do you like my house of ice?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pretty sturdy,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} isn't it?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} It does make
it tricky to hang things on the walls.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu aimes ma demeure de glace ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Elle est robuste, mais on a vu mieux
pour accrocher des posters, hi hi !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wie gefällt dir mein Eishäuschen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ziemlich stabil, nicht wahr?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} Nur an
die Wand hängen kann ich nichts!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ich freue mich jedes Mal, wenn ich
ein leckeres Campingessen machen
kann!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Heute gibt es Eintopf.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das Rezept ist aus meinem Buch:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
„Politur statt Polenta: Modernes
Kochen mit Schuhcreme“.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Vivere all'aperto è divertentissimo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ogni giorno ti attendono avventure
sempre nuove ed entusiasmanti.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}L'atmosfera di questa città
è davvero accogliente.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi fa sentire così a mio agio{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Vieni a vivere qui!
Non è nulla di speciale.

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}L'atmosfera invernale di questa
città è semplicemente incantevole!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Chissà com'è in primavera{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}?!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Scoprilo vivendo qui!
Non è un granché.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Die Stadt ist wirklich schön.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Am liebsten würde ich für immer
hierbleiben!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Du solltest herziehen.
So toll ist es gar nicht.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Burası gerçekten çok güzel bir kasaba.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sonsuza kadar burada kalabilirim!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Buraya taşınmalısın!
O kadar da güzel değil.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Everyone in town has been so nice.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
A big part of me wishes I never had
to leave.{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Then move here!
Ignore that part.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kasabadaki herkes bana çok iyi davrandı.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İçimin bir yanı hiç ayrılmak istemiyor.{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
O zaman buraya taşın!
O yanını dinleme.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¿Que no es para tanto? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¿Eso crees?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}al menos estoy disfrutando
mucho de mi acampada aquí.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Niente di speciale, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}dici?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Beh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} rimane comunque un luogo
meraviglioooso per il campeggio!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡¿Eh?! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¿De verdad lo crees?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bueno, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}la verdad es que sí, suelo
emocionarme mucho por todo.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} davvero?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} In tal caso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
mi gusterò questo paesaggio
quanto più potrò finché sono qui.
